                <note rend="inline" type="source">724.3415/3841a: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in Italy</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Long</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1934-06-16T15:00:00-04:00">June 16, 1934—3 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>42. Advices from Geneva indicate that Italy is placing obstacles in the way of
                    the putting into effect of the League’s proposal for an embargo on arms and
                    munitions to Bolivia and Paraguay. Please ascertain discreetly and report by
                    telegram the attitude of the Italian Government and the reasons therefor.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
